WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.089
E D B lists only two file-access methods.

00:00:03.089 --> 00:00:04.973
First, sequential access.

00:00:04.973 --> 00:00:07.234
Typical medium: magnetic tape.

00:00:07.234 --> 00:00:13.262
You must read from start to end in order; seek time is long and hard to predict.

00:00:13.262 --> 00:00:16.728
Common for batch processing or offline backup.
